; Starter chart of accounts. Adjust to match your own ledger, then reference
; these accounts from the templates in src/banking_pipeline/beancount_writer.py.
;
; Per-ISIN accounts (Assets:Investments:<ISIN> and Income:Dividends:<ISIN>)
; are generated automatically by render_open_directives() in beancount_writer.py
; and do not need to be listed here by hand.

2020-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Checking                  EUR
2020-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Savings                   EUR
2020-01-01 open Assets:Broker:Cash                    EUR, USD, GBP
2020-01-01 open Income:Interest
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Banking:Fees
2020-01-01 open Equity:Uncategorized

; Examples of per-ISIN accounts produced automatically at render time:
; 2020-01-01 open Assets:Investments:LU2096759431  LU2096759431
; 2020-01-01 open Income:Dividends:LU2096759431
